# 📊 Complexity

Backtracking generally explores all possibilities.

Worst Case

```
O(b^d)
```

Where

```
b = Branching Factor

d = Depth
```

---

### Space Complexity

```
O(d)
```

(Call Stack)

---

# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Backtracking always follows

```
Choose

↓

Explore

↓

Undo
```

---

✅ Every Backtracking problem uses Recursion.

---

✅ Backtracking explores **all possible solutions**.

---

✅ Undoing the previous choice is the most important step.

---

✅ Decision Trees help visualize recursive branching.

